sequenceDiagram
    participant Buyer
    participant Frontend
    participant Backend
    participant OrderRepo
    participant PaymentRepo
    participant DB
    participant SePay

    Note over Buyer,SePay: Phase 1 — Place Order

    Buyer->>Frontend: Click "Đặt hàng" on /checkout
    Frontend->>Backend: POST /api/v1/orders<br/>{shipping_address: {street, ward, district, province}}
    Backend->>OrderRepo: save(Order)
    OrderRepo->>DB: INSERT INTO orders (status=PENDING, payment_status=PENDING)
    DB-->>OrderRepo: Order
    Backend->>OrderRepo: save(OrderItems) — stock already decremented by placeOrder()
    Backend-->>Frontend: 201 Created {orderId}
    Frontend->>Frontend: Redirect to /checkout/payment?orderId=xxx

    Note over Buyer,SePay: Phase 2 — Initiate SEPay Payment

    Buyer->>Frontend: /checkout/payment page loads
    Frontend->>Backend: POST /api/v1/orders/{orderId}/pay

    Backend->>OrderRepo: findById(orderId)
    OrderRepo->>DB: SELECT * FROM orders WHERE id = ?
    DB-->>OrderRepo: Order
    OrderRepo-->>Backend: Order

    alt Order not found / wrong owner / cancelled / already paid
        Backend-->>Frontend: 400/403/404 Error
        Frontend-->>Buyer: Show error message
    end

    Backend->>PaymentRepo: save(Payment{method=SEPAY, status=PENDING, invoiceNumber="ORD-XXXXXXXX"})
    PaymentRepo->>DB: INSERT INTO payments (method='SEPAY', status='PENDING')
    DB-->>PaymentRepo: Payment
    PaymentRepo-->>Backend: Payment

    Backend->>Backend: SePayService.createCheckoutFields()<br/>HMAC-SHA256 sign all fields with secret_key
    Backend-->>Frontend: 200 OK {checkoutUrl, formFields}

    Frontend->>Frontend: Render hidden <form> with auto-submit<br/>action=SEPay checkout URL, method=POST

    Note over Buyer,SePay: Phase 3 — Pay on SEPay

    Frontend->>SePay: Auto-submit form → POST /v1/checkout/init<br/>{merchant, order_invoice_number, order_amount,<br/>currency, payment_method, signature, ...}
    SePay->>SePay: Validate signature, create payment session

    alt Invalid signature
        SePay-->>Frontend: Error page
        Frontend-->>Buyer: Show error
    end

    SePay-->>Buyer: Redirect to SEPay payment page
    Buyer->>SePay: Select payment method (VietQR / Card)<br/>Complete payment

    Note over Buyer,SePay: Phase 4 — SEPay Confirms Payment

    alt Payment successful
        SePay->>Backend: POST /api/v1/payments/ipn<br/>Headers: X-Secret-Key<br/>Body: {notification_type: "ORDER_PAID",<br/>order: {order_invoice_number: "ORD-XXXXXXXX"},<br/>transaction: {transaction_status: "APPROVED"}}

        Backend->>Backend: SePayService.verifyIpnSignature(X-Secret-Key)
        alt Invalid IPN signature
            Backend-->>SePay: 400 Invalid signature
        end

        Backend->>PaymentRepo: findByInvoiceNumber("ORD-XXXXXXXX")
        PaymentRepo->>DB: SELECT * FROM payments WHERE invoice_number = ?
        DB-->>PaymentRepo: Payment
        PaymentRepo-->>Backend: Payment (status=PENDING)

        alt Payment already completed (idempotent)
            Backend-->>SePay: 200 OK (skip)
        else New payment
            Backend->>PaymentRepo: save(Payment{status=COMPLETED})
            PaymentRepo->>DB: UPDATE payments SET status='COMPLETED' WHERE id = ?
            Backend->>OrderRepo: save(Order{paymentStatus=PAID})
            OrderRepo->>DB: UPDATE orders SET payment_status='PAID' WHERE id = ?
            Backend-->>SePay: 200 OK {success: true}
        end

        SePay->>Frontend: Redirect to success_url → /orders/{id}?payment=success
        Frontend-->>Buyer: Show success banner ✅

    else Payment failed
        SePay->>Backend: POST /api/v1/payments/ipn<br/>{notification_type: "ORDER_PAID",<br/>transaction: {transaction_status: "FAILED"}}
        Backend->>PaymentRepo: save(Payment{status=FAILED, failureReason=...})
        Backend-->>SePay: 200 OK

        SePay->>Frontend: Redirect to error_url → /orders/{id}?payment=error
        Frontend-->>Buyer: Show error banner ❌

    else Buyer cancelled
        SePay->>Frontend: Redirect to cancel_url → /orders/{id}?payment=cancelled
        Frontend-->>Buyer: Show cancelled banner ⚠️
    end
